    "description": "Create a new listing on the Mangrove Marketplace.\n\nArgs:\n    seller_address: Seller's wallet address (XRPL r..., EVM 0x..., or Solana base58).\n    price_xrp: Price amount. Denominated in `currency` on `chain`.\n    currency: Settlement currency -- 'XRP' (default), 'USDC', etc.\n    chain: Settlement chain -- 'xrpl' (default), 'solana', 'base'.\n    fulfillment_type: 'digital' (default), 'service', or 'physical'.\n    delivery_evidence_schema: Optional JSON Schema the delivery proof must\n        satisfy before escrow release (used by verifiable-delivery flows).\n",
