    "description": "Rate a completed marketplace transaction (buyer or seller).\n\nCan be called by either party after delivery is confirmed.\nScore must be 1 (worst) to 5 (best).\n\nArgs:\n    offer_id: ID of the completed offer.\n    rater_address: Address of the rater (buyer or seller).\n    score: Rating score from 1 to 5.\n    comment: Optional text feedback.\n",
